{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2679c0ffa569d9a8a61bb6e0483960fa57d0d98e7bccd1cde49dd425f3e05621",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a729a344ab5f08f6bae39caade47546aa24e855bc6d5b1ea6cdb18af1bb61e25",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deda0cad4eb37a2fafeaaf5167bee4ab13e952440e97db85b31d95faf120cc2f",
      "text": "那个，我有事想跟您说。\n能耽误您一点点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90b928e4e41c7a5b160c1bb2e87ad2f33b76e6a67bf98744cee652d42796d8c7",
      "text": "我收到了在毕业典礼上的小朋友寄来的粉丝信。\n好像是妈妈代写的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5755ae89d7aa4ce85d13ab0600230871a2a64a4d1685a7f80eb87232b0947d44",
      "text": "那个孩子毕业之后就要搬到很远的地方，\n所以一想到要和朋友分开，就寂寞得不得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da0979e31e59a86276b0bec20832f114aed40dc9f1f231899848fd1630d7d87",
      "text": "可是，看了我们的演出之后，\n想着在搬去的地方或许也能交到新朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15f4f8c9c81fef21506fd7f8518e2c4530785e80b9f1a60092df3653f2b33685",
      "text": "信上写着，只要这么想，\n就变得积极起来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa102eab13c8d10b05888b4da4ec3bcf569a4b36407cdf380bbf98e0e0cc262",
      "text": "能成为别人鼓起勇气的契机，\n原来是这么令人高兴的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11c2d5fa28f06cd91d5e212d97b6b0a8588d1f8af5c89ff5251225dbdeee2e74",
      "text": "太好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5bf63eac5fedf60a09c119fda7752da1286d2f4fd39e2cae5d662e2b9b5e57",
      "text": "真是一段佳话呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e94776df7064fcb5067fad6040174a8aced2e5f97957c089e778c9e756df32e3",
      "text": "虽然我还是会紧张，也没法一下子就变厉害……\n但我想一步一步慢慢努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aa5c7e5d4ef680cf31519219117e2d236d62ca845a35ae279da525ee11e2293",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢您听我倾诉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_304_2_3_032_04_09_a:2_3_032_04_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e00a13ff5718db89e3cd6f4d495b50c1cbd88cc9eef5992845281e599d2e7e0",
      "text": "明天起也请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
